# Secrets are never committed. A file named `env.text` on the mongodb branch held a live
# JWT signing key and the OTP pepper, pushed to this repository — anyone who could read
# the repo could forge an access token for any user, including Super Admin. Both have to
# be rotated; these patterns stop the next one arriving the same way.
env.text
*.env.text
secrets.*
*.secrets
